    "title": "【自定义】视线追踪 大黑塔⌈跨次元的注视⌋ 崩坏:星穹铁道 [Eye following The Herta]——AL_汤缘",
    "description": "使用前注意在用户属性面板关闭提示栏（因为害怕有些人错过自定义功能，原谅我）。\r\n\r\n自定义功能介绍：\r\n\r\n1.可以选择人物的样式（默认视线和头部跟踪版），分别有视线跟踪和头部跟踪、随音频响应跳动、无跟踪静态动画。原谅我不能完美解决人物位置的问题。\r\n\r\n2.可以选择喜欢的背景样式（默认纯色），分别有纯色背景、渐变色背景、自定义背景、添加上下音频跳动纯色条（默认关闭）。可以选择符合自己的样式，\r\n\r\n原谅我想不出其他样式了(*╹▽╹*)。\r\n\r\n3.简单的时间，简单的鼠标拖尾。\r\n\r\n没有更多的花样了，怕审美疲劳❛‿˂̵✧，第一次做数量大的自定义功能，做的我晕头转向的，希望不会出大问题。\r\n\r\n欢迎反馈问题（虽然一般不会修改，但是吸取教训）玩的开心☆☆\r\n\r\nPlease note to turn off the prompt bar in the user attribute panel before use (for fear that some people might miss the custom function. Please forgive me). \r\n\r\nCustom Function Introduction: \r\n\r\nYou can choose the character style (default is the eye and head tracking version), which includes eye tracking and head tracking, audio response jumping, and no tracking static animation. Please forgive me for not being able to perfectly solve the problem of character position. \r\n\r\n2. You can choose your favorite background style (default solid color), including solid color background, gradient color background, custom background, and add top and bottom audio beat solid color bars (default off). You can select the style that suits you. \r\n\r\nForgive me for not being able to think of any other styles. (*╹▽╹*) \r\n\r\n3. Simple time, simple mouse trail. \r\n\r\nThere are no more tricks left. I'm afraid of causing aesthetic fatigue. It's the first time I've done a large number of custom functions, and it's got me all confused. I hope there won't be any major issues. \r\n\r\nWelcome to give feedback on any problems (Although usually not modified, I'll learn from them). Have fun! ☆☆",
